{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26067","headline":"经旧游 · 鲍溶","name":"经旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游鱼怀故池，倦鸟怀故窠。\n故山系归念，行坐青巍峨。\n羸马经旧途，此乡喜重过。\n居人无故老，倍感别日多。\n但见野中坟，累累如青螺。\n凉风日摇落，桑下松婆娑。\n叹息追古人，临风伤逝波。\n古人无不死，叹息欲如何。\n朅来遂远心，默默存天和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}